  "name": "Oven-Baked Jambalaya",
  "subtitle": "A hearty baked rice dish with sausage, chicken, ham, and shrimp",
  "description": "A generously sized jambalaya combines sautéed vegetables, tomatoes, seasoned stock, cooked meats, shrimp, and rice before baking until tender.",
